                "description": "The Santa Fe Lever with Regular Rose is interesting and beautiful. It is available in a wide array of traditional finish color options. The Santa Fe Lever with Round Rosette will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
